    "60,1": { "_doc": "Dometic compressor fridge (bus 60 = DometicCompressorFridge). Universal across EHG brands (HYMER, Eriba, ...) — created only when the vehicle reports bus 60 (require_observed). Slot 1 = UserMode (string rw per decompiled EHG app componentId 60, id 1): 'Performance Cooling'/'Silent Mode'/'Turbo Mode'. Read sensor for the writable fridge_dometic_mode select.", "name": "dometic_fridge_mode", "platform": "sensor", "require_observed": true, "icon": "mdi:fridge" },
