    "_tpms_doc": "TPMS (EHG bus 100, component 'TPMS', kind tpms). Universal optional component - observation-gated so it only materialises on vehicles that actually report bus 100. Pressures are int with a declared range 0-9500 'psi'; that range implies a scaled raw unit (e.g. psi*100), so pressures are shipped enabled:false with SCALE UNVERIFIED until a TPMS-equipped vehicle confirms the transform. Temperatures are EHG floats (direct degC per the Alde/Truma convention; -273 = no-data sentinel). Status/firmware are strings (safe decode).",
    "100,1": { "name": "tpms_pressure_fr", "require_observed": true, "platform": "sensor", "device_class": "pressure", "unit": "psi", "state_class": "measurement", "enabled": false, "icon": "mdi:car-tire-alert" },
